~ condition_stabilized
# Reading diary
Danilo: I didn’t realize you were going through all this...
Danilo: [shake]I thought you were happy...[/shake]
Danilo: [wave]I’m sorry, Mateo.[/wave]

# Mateo appears
do ghost_appears.emit("relief")
=> END

~ relief_mateo_appeared
Danilo: Mateo?
Mateo: [wave]Exactly![/wave]
Danilo: ... ...
Mateo: Aren’t you happy to see me?
Danilo: I can’t believe I’m actually talking to you.
Mateo: ...
Danilo: I waited for you for so long, and now [wave]I’ve found you[/wave].
do mateo_turn("relief")
=> END

~ relief_mateo_turned
# Mateo turns away
Mateo: ... [wave]Come with me[/wave]
Danilo: Where are we going? Wait for me.
# Mateo walks
do mateo_walk_down("relief")
=> END

~ relief_cliff
# transition outside / cliff
Mateo: Danilo... there’s still so many things I wanted to do with you all.
Danilo: ...
Mateo: So many things I wanted to say... so many moments I wanted to feel again.
Mateo: But thank you, Danilo.
Mateo: [wave]Because you found me[/wave]... I can finally rest.
Mateo: It doesn’t hurt anymore. It’s not scary anymore.
Mateo: Everything feels... light. Like the wind is just carrying me somewhere peaceful.
Mateo: Do you remember that promise I made before?
Mateo: The one where I said I’d show you something if I won at hide-and-seek?
Danilo: Yeah... I remember, it's the chapel, right?
Mateo: Heh... you found it first. Guess you won after all.
Mateo: I wanted to bring you there back then... so you could see how peaceful it was.
Mateo: But... I’m sorry, Danilo. I couldn’t keep my promise.
Mateo: I wanted to... but unexpected things happened.
Mateo: [shake rate=20 level=10]I got scared. [/shake]
Mateo: [shake rate=20 level=10]And before I knew it... everything turned dark.[/shake]
Mateo: [shake rate=20 level=10]I didn’t mean to leave you.[/shake]
Danilo: It’s not your fault, Mateo. None of it was.
Mateo: ...Then, can I still say... [wave amp=25 freq=5][i]thank you[/i][/wave]?
Mateo: Because even after all this time... you still found me.
do _ghost_left("relief")
# Mateo fading away
do _ghost_vanish("relief")
Danilo: Just a moment, Mateo.
Danilo: There’s so much I still want to tell you.
Danilo: We moved to Manila.
Danilo: I have a job now.
Danilo: Wendy... she’s a psychiatrist.
Danilo: So much happened without you here...
Danilo: So many little moments I wish you could’ve seen.
Danilo: Just for a moment, stay here with me.
# Mateo fading away continues, and finishes
Mateo: Thank you for finding me.
Mateo: Even if I couldn’t keep my promises, you... you never forgot. 
Danilo: I won’t forget, Mateo.
Mateo: Just... promise me... you’ll live well, Danilo. 
Mateo: Even without me...
Danilo: I promise... I’ll remember you, always.  
Danilo: Until then... rest. Please, rest. 
Mateo: Farewell... Danilo.  
do whitey_vanish_full()
do act_5_scene_8_done()
=> END

