~ condition_worsened
# Reading diary
Danilo: Mateo... oh God... you hid all of this from us...
# Chapel darkens, sound effects
Danilo: I thought... you were happy... that nothing was weighing you down...
Danilo: I never knew... you were hiding all that behind your laughter...
Danilo: But I let you down.
Danilo: Mateo... I’m sorry...
# Ghost appears
do _candle_dim()
do ghost_appears.emit("restless")
=> END

~ resltess_ghost_appeared
Entity: ...Danilo... why... did you leave me...?
Danilo: Mateo... is that you?
Danilo: [shake]No... this isn’t right...[/shake]
Entity: You promised you’d never leave...
Danilo: [shake]I didn’t... I searched everywhere for you![/shake]
do show_distortion()
Entity: Lies... [wave freq=10 amp=20]You forgot me...[/wave]
Danilo: [shake]No! I never forgot![/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=25 level=15]Then why did I die alone?![/shake]
#=> END
#
#~ restless_ghost_turn_and_walk_a_bit
do _candle_dimmer()
do mateo_turn("restless")
Entity: Come... this way... Danilo... here...
do mateo_walk_down("restless")
=> END

~ restless_cliff
# transition outside / cliff
# Shadow stands near edge
Danilo: Mateo... please... stop...
Entity: ...
# Look down
do _ghost_down("restless")
Entity: ...
Danilo: Just a moment...
Entity: ...
Danilo: [shake]I don’t want to lose you again.[/shake]
Entity: You already did...
Entity: [shake rate=30 level=20][color=#ff5555]YOU LEAVE ME![/color][/shake]
# Look left
do _ghost_left("restless")
Entity: The wind is waiting, Danilo.
Danilo: Just a moment... please...
Entity: It’s your turn to fall.
Danilo: Don’t leave me yet... Mateo!
Entity: [fade]...[/fade]
Entity: [shake rate=30 level=20][color=#ff5555]Join me.[/color][/shake]
Danilo: [wave freq=5 amp=10][i]I’m sorry... I’m so sorry...[/i][/wave]
do _ghost_vanish("restless")
Danilo: [shake rate=10 level=8]My body... it’s so cold... I... can’t...[/shake]
do _go_to_next_scene()
# Shadow fades to nothing
# Danilo collapses at the edge. The voices scream louder, swallowing him in darkness.
=> END
